  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to Horticultural Development Council</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To build organisational  capacity at Horticultural Development Council in order to improve the member horticulturalists&#x2019; access to finance and implementation of sustainability policies. Ultimately, this is to improve the livelihoods of small-scale horticulture growers and widen employment in the sector.</narrative>
  </description>
